Package: rpi-fake-sleep
Version: 1.1.8
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Depends: python3, python3-gi, systemd
Description: Universal Userspace Sleep & Standby Manager for Raspberry Pi
 Enables native Standby/Ruhezustand on Raspberry Pi systems where the kernel
 lacks ACPI S3 or stable s2idle support.
 Integrates with systemd-suspend and systemd-logind to handle lid switch,
 UI sleep button, and power saving (cgroups v2 freeze, CPU governor throttling,
 display blanking, and instant wakeup via input events).
